<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Stratus Computer raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stratus Computer raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs has raised its rating for Stratus Computer Inc to a recommended list buy from trading buy, a source at the brokerage said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Marlboro, Mass., computer systems maker opened up two at 31-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
